// Adversarial: Momentum at 1 stack, scripted setup, verifies a split actually fires.
//
// Momentum splits a Cell into two child cells the first time a bolt bump
// reduces it to or below half its original HP. At 1 stack the threshold is
// exactly 50% HP. The Corridor layout provides a column of normal cells
// with a clear vertical lane; the bolt bounces repeatedly in that lane,
// accumulating damage events on the same cell until the split threshold
// is crossed.
//
// Adversarial properties:
//   - Cell count must GROW from the initial baseline: a split means the
//     original cell is removed and two children are inserted, so total
//     cell count after the first split is initial + 1. BreakerCountReasonable
//     is replaced by cell-count bookkeeping via HazardStackValid and NoEntityLeaks.
//   - Cell count must stay bounded: runaway splits (splitting children that
//     were themselves spawned by Momentum) should not produce exponential
//     growth. If HP-reset-on-split is broken, each child immediately
//     qualifies for another split at its own 50% threshold -- without the
//     reset the count grows every ~2 ticks. The BreakerCountReasonable
//     invariant is reused here to confirm entity counts remain sane;
//     NoEntityLeaks catches any orphaned split-message entity.
//   - No NaN: split children inherit a fraction of the parent HP. If the
//     arithmetic produces a zero or negative denominator (e.g. parent HP
//     already 0 when the message arrives), NaN propagates into subsequent
//     damage events.
//
// 500 frames is enough for multiple bolt circuits in Corridor; if no split
// fires within 500 frames, the Momentum activation path or damage pipeline
// is silently broken.
(
    breaker: "Aegis",
    layout: "Corridor",
    input: Scripted((
        actions: [],
    )),
    max_frames: 500,
    disallowed_failures: [
        NoNaN,
        BoltInBounds,
        BreakerInBounds,
        HazardStackValid,
        NoEntityLeaks,
    ],
    allowed_failures: None,
    debug_setup: None,
    allow_early_end: false,
    frame_mutations: [
        (frame: 5, mutation: InjectHazardStack(kind_name: "Momentum", stacks: 1)),
    ],
)
